# EAS Build only needs the Expo app in mobile/. The repo root also holds docs/,
# images/, source books, prototypes, marketing and wiki — none of which are part
# of the iOS build, and together they bloated the upload archive to ~201 MB
# (causing flaky "socket hang up" uploads). Keep only mobile/.
#
# NOTE: a .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for EAS's file selection, so we must
# also re-exclude the heavy/generated files that .gitignore normally hides
# (node_modules, prebuilt ios/android, .expo, credentials, env, etc.).

# 1) Ignore every top-level entry...
/*

# 2) ...except the Expo app directory.
!/mobile

# 3) Re-exclude generated/secret files inside mobile/ (mirrors mobile/.gitignore).
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/.expo-verify-out/
mobile/dist/
mobile/web-build/
mobile/ios/
mobile/android/
mobile/.kotlin/
mobile/coverage/
mobile/.metro-health-check*
mobile/credentials/
mobile/credentials.json
mobile/.env
mobile/.env*.local
mobile/*.tsbuildinfo
mobile/e2e-shots/*.png
mobile/**/*.orig.*
mobile/**/*.jks
mobile/**/*.p8
mobile/**/*.p12
mobile/**/*.key
mobile/**/*.mobileprovision
mobile/**/*.pem

# Misc
.DS_Store
